    "summary": "Bearer: a **NECRONS** model.\n\nOnce per battle, for your whole army, as your opponent's turn ends, you can activate this ability, provided the bearer's unit is **[unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)**. Doing so:\n\n- puts the unit into [Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)\n- gives it [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike) until [your next Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase)\n- obliges it to arrive by **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), even in your first turn",
